# Hand a robot another robot's map of a region, to be merged into its own.
#
# The receiving half of a map exchange in stale_map_demo. How a cell the two
# maps read differently is settled is the receiver's merge rule, a parameter
# of the receiver and not of the message: epistemic_slam::MergeRule.

string source
string region
nav_msgs/OccupancyGrid map
float64[] observed

---

bool ok
string message

# The rule the receiver merged by.
string rule

# Over the region's cells: cells the receiver had not observed and now holds;
# settled readings it replaced; contradicting readings it kept.
uint32 learned
uint32 changed
uint32 kept

# What the receiver's map says of the region before and after.
string verdict_before
string verdict_after
